OL,3,GNEWSATeenage boy, 16, killed in
OL,4,Amotorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy was killed and another is
OL,7,Fin a critical condition after the
OL,8,Felectric motorbike they were riding was
OL,9,Finvolved in a collision with a car.
OL,11,FA 16-year-old, who police believe was
OL,12,Fon the back of the bike, died at the
OL,13,Fscene after emergency services were
OL,14,Fcalled to East Reach in Taunton,
OL,15,FSomerset at 22:20 BST on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe other boy was taken to hospital by
OL,18,Fair ambulance after the incident, which
OL,19,Fhappened near the junction with Haydon
OL,20,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
