OL,3,GNEWSATeenage boy, 16, killed in
OL,4,Amotorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police has launched
OL,7,Fan investigation into the fatal
OL,8,Fcollision, and officers are trying to
OL,9,Flocate the motorbike, which was not
OL,10,Fleft at the site of the crash.
